{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b3428c675bc5731e8f39f53b988f09f9017b37e2bebe1b75bc5e92dc687a13f4", "ja": "（今日は響と『天使』がテーマのPV撮影にきた。\n撮影までまだ時間があるけど、響は悩んでいる様子だ）", "zh": "（今天和响一起来拍摄以“天使”为主题的PV。距离开拍还有一段时间，但响似乎正在烦恼）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "d8f6a98252a24b5e7117c72d201bfd9f2955d9196908c9653652e3055e0c241d", "ja": "うぎゃー！　どうすればいいんだ！\n天使……雲の上で……歌う！？　うう～！", "zh": "哇啊——！该怎么办才好啊！\n天使……在云朵上……唱歌！？唔唔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "8f64ad1366b36eb2411116bf1bb1f61a5d179d49e0d6919c69fb4a9026e2cfe4", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}！\n今回の撮影、自分は歌う天使の役なんだよね！？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}！\n这次拍摄，我要演唱歌的天使，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1003_p", "source_sha256": "bbe3f6adc5858516a9eb6dccf1daf5931851c3f1728ccfb9a81483e0e4d60355", "ja": "まあ、そうなるな。撮影は合成だから、\n本当に空を飛ぶわけじゃないけど……。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。因为拍摄时会进行合成，\n不是真的要飞上天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "15f1219bdfe0baa53993963e123cd2718a6a3700a2b434339a96eeebb3d21388", "ja": "当たり前でしょ！　いくらカンペキな\n自分だって、空は飛べないぞ～！", "zh": "那是当然的吧！就算我再怎么完美，\n也没法飞上天啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "dc17bfb008a37820a3eb41da940628f4e8da24a92eb23410ef6aa7fd0c525cc6", "ja": "飛んでる自分なんて、イメージできない～！\nこれが海ならカンタンなのに……う～！", "zh": "完全想象不出自己飞起来的样子～！\n要是这里是大海，就简单多了……呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c0454e23def6064f2c205ec8ba36e30a6e10143f735ec7caa145dde3e258606b", "ja": "ん？　海の中のことだったら\nすぐにイメージできるのか？", "zh": "嗯？如果是海里的事，就能马上想象出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "61ab830278915a5cf89b1e647c943257769966dab53e0892dc37ea8057cb72ca", "ja": "そうだぞ。自分、素潜りは得意だし、沖縄の海も\n他の海も、いろいろ泳いだことあるもんね。", "zh": "就是啊。我很擅长自由潜水，冲绳的海也好，其他地方的海也好，都游过不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "4bd81e075483ba54ba8092893243a035784ec80fa35a0593f1d5bdacaadc40a7", "ja": "海の上でプカプカって浮いてると、\nすっごく穏やかな気持ちになれるんだ！", "zh": "漂在海面上时，心情就会变得特别平静呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5b8c2ffdc3c5f2b8a3b438e5f04ca43822ad0ccc74d35f274f7302a1234fb0eb", "ja": "ふむ……なら、空を海だと思えばいいんじゃないか？\nなんとなく似てる気がするし。", "zh": "嗯……那么，把天空当成大海不就行了吗？\n总觉得它们有点像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "c0a6e25f8e8eea2604ccf8b5d84fe5be21d2c6961889e5f6b2dc51b57bcab05d", "ja": "あっ、そっか！　たしかに、\nすっご～く広いところとか、似てる気がするね。", "zh": "啊，对哦！确实，\n像是都特别～特别宽广呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a3b2624353c3f724bf3df9ca4f16d97abeb4ba60bc9284db10bb38bbd0fa2f52", "ja": "だったら……空を飛ぶんじゃなくて、\n空を泳ぐ自分をイメージすればいいんだ！", "zh": "既然这样……那就想象自己不是在天空中飞翔，而是在天空中游泳吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "786c1364f5adc8cda51958a097f5d1c480c722786cf8a6d4a661497990de4734", "ja": "青空の真ん中を、ゆっくりと泳いで……。\nたまに鳥たちが遊びに来るから挨拶をして！", "zh": "在蓝天中央，慢慢地游着……\n偶尔有鸟儿来玩，就跟它们打个招呼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "2b112ecb14cbcaff256a801f3ef136db8027cfaa77c7e7eafe95d10d73a5320a", "ja": "ありがとねっ、{$P$}！\n自分、感じが掴めた気がする！", "zh": "谢谢啦，{$P$}！\n我好像找到感觉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3fb80f83dae56d113b90a1e0a1493da1892a4a2277287da4f7ab4be1401ab7e2", "ja": "少しでも役に立てたなら良かったよ。\n今日のPV撮影、いけそうか？", "zh": "能帮上一点忙就好。\n今天的PV拍摄，感觉有把握吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "f532f17ea519a440bfc876b07d4cb6511e96f70625b4ba20946c7e2fac53d03a", "ja": "えへへ、バッチリ！　今すぐでもいけるぞ。\n空の上まで、ひとっ飛びさ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，完美！现在马上开始也没问题哦。\n飞到天上去，一跃就能到啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1016_p", "source_sha256": "778df300ef1e1ccdc1d9e5798df678bc1ffec8be1a2d4bb107233829c1299616", "ja": "よし、その意気だ。\n撮影、期待しているからな！", "zh": "好，就是这个劲头。\n我很期待你的拍摄表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0183_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f2086da3a1d5d126facbd0f3aea9642671b9a21d56fd5973867a98bac002158", "ja": "うん、任せて！　空を泳ぐ気持ちよさ、\nみんなに教えてあげるぞっ！", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧！我会把翱翔天空的畅快感觉教给大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
